{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-24T17:07:43.588Z","data":{"text":"Task complete.\n\n**Summary**\n\nImplemented `src/deployments/reconcile.ts` and `tests/reconcile-plan.test.ts` for task 1 of `011-reconcile`.\n\n- `planReconcile` detects:\n  - `running` deployments with a missing/`null` container → `container disappeared`\n  - listed-but-not-running containers → `container exited with code <n>` or `container is not running`\n  - `pending`/`pulling`/`starting` deployments past the stuck threshold (default 10 min) → `stuck in <status> since <at>`\n  - orphans: `paas.app`-labelled managed containers not owned by a staying deployment, with `paas-caddy` (no `paas.app`) never reported. Failures sort by app, orphans by container name. It mutates nothing.\n- `applyReconcile` marks failures `failed`, force-removes orphans only with `prune` (missing containers count as removed), reports otherwise, and continues past failed removals.\n\n**Verification**\n- `node --import tsx --test tests/reconcile-plan.test.ts` → all pass\n- `pnpm exec tsc -p tsconfig.json` → clean\n- `pnpm verify` → 356 pass, 0 fail\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/011-reconcile/.run/results/1.md`."}}
